# CLI development

**Authority:** [`docs/CLI.md`](../../docs/CLI.md). Agent workflow: [`.agents/skills/click-cli/SKILL.md`](../../.agents/skills/click-cli/SKILL.md).

| Rule | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| Thin wiring | Commands call library APIs; extract fat logic to packages before adding flags |
| Flat commands | New leaves register on the root Click group unless roadmap widens scope |
| Exit-code contract | Gate commands documented in `docs/CLI.md`; fail closed |
| Same-PR docs | Command names, flags, defaults, exit codes synced across CLI.md and README surfaces |
| No Rich/Typer | Click only in default `[project.dependencies]` |
| Tests | CliRunner wiring for new/changed commands; domain contracts stay in gold/discovery/eval suites |
| Coverage | Keep `cli/` omitted from the 92% gate; wiring tests are the contract |

Scripts under `scripts/` stay argparse unless individually promoted per `docs/CLI.md`.
